  unitName: Flaring Massacre Rize
  unitId: 40576
  unitNumber: 919
  description: A demon once feared for her destructive power. Rize had turned her
    back on things such as supremacy and conquest. According to legend, however,
    there was one demon whom she considered her mortal enemy, and whom she willingly
    attacked with the full intention of winning. The identity of this demon remains
    unknown though, as does any record telling of the conclusion of such battle.
    This is all probably due to the fact that Rize completely wiped out everything
    and everyone in her immediate vicinity when fighting against her bitter rival.
  summonDesc: "That one was different from me\u2026 Such a pure intent of destruction,
    turning all to nothing..."
  fusionDesc: Are you trying to break me? How cute. Kinda makes me wanna destroy
    you...
  evoDesc: You don't fear me? You need me? One day, that will be a lie. But for now,
    I'll believe you...
  element: 4
  rarity: 6
